<title>USA: Standard Pacific sells $100 mln snr notes.</title>
<headline>Standard Pacific sells $100 mln snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Standard Pacific Corp was offered on Thursday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Standard Pacific builds medium-priced single family homes</p>
<p>in California and Texas.</p>
<p>BORROWER STANDARD PACIFIC CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	COUPON 8.50 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES    ISS PRICE 99.306   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2  YIELD 8.605 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P BB		SPREAD 212.5 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit))</p>
</text>
